  <item>
    <title>47 | 98年生的调酒师，以及他如何用酒精编织一夜限定的梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64b0e6255680f4d4a8c3034b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64b0e6255680f4d4a8c3034b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Jul 2023 06:07:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是你再想想。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们请来了A Tompson Hotel与Laundry Co.的调酒师屿伦，听听他聊作为调酒师的职场和人生趣事。屿伦同时也是申必人的柔术训练伙伴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>哦，也谢谢他请我们喝酒。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>某个不好说正不正规的“神秘奶茶店”成为了屿伦调酒师生涯的启蒙。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>从程序员到调酒师，从广东到上海。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>刚入行的时候，屿伦被要求连续七天整夜坐在酒吧里。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>如果我要点一杯梵高的“星夜”，阁下又该如何应对？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>猜猜万千鸡尾酒里点单率最高的那一款是啥？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>回头客到底是买调酒师的手艺还是买和调酒师聊天的情感价值？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>失恋、买醉、失恋对象在现场。一出三幕剧。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>对于社区型酒吧的畅想。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>打比赛、做业绩还是研发新产品？或者你也可以卖冰块给酒吧。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>常年昼伏夜出晚四早四，调酒师要谈恋爱挺不容易。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsNQqKVhuhMXG6BCjUce27nD7fWj.m4a" length="116457988" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZrRks1eV9pQVdtdDJGMmdfRWltZS1iT25UdjUucG5n.png"/>
